=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}(\\varphi,T)\\land\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Gamma}(\\neg\\varphi,T)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d}}(\\varphi,T)\\land\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Gamma}(\\neg\\varphi,T)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷64–65页/PDF75–76页定理3(a)。正句是对偶类保守，负句是原类保守，方向不可交换而不同时交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>。源证明由加强的双边 numeration 构造和引理4给出；引理4的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1\">\\(i=1\\)</span> 情形留给读者。本次核对陈述及已写的构造论证，没有补全留给读者的编码分支，故保留证明限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\ge1$；$(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^{\\mathrm d})\\in\\{(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n),(\\Pi_n,\\Sigma_n)\\}$，公式类取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df